---
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import '../../styles/about-brief.css';
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout bodyClass="site-refined"><Fragment slot="head"><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>About me | Emma Siddons, independent Hertfordshire buying agent</title><meta name="description" content="Get to know me and my approach to finding your next home. Independent advice, detailed local knowledge and a personal property search service."><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="theme-color" content="#344d3d"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><link rel="canonical" href="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/about-me/"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Emma Siddons"><meta property="og:title" content="About me | Emma Siddons, independent Hertfordshire buying agent"><meta property="og:description" content="Get to know me and my approach to finding your next home. Independent advice, detailed local knowledge and a personal property search service."><meta property="og:url" content="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/about-me/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/images/about-brief-0.webp"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Emma Siddons outdoors in Hertfordshire"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/BaseLayout.B6McQ5pf.css"></Fragment> <a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a> <SiteHeader />  <main id="main"><div data-retired> <section class="page-intro split-banner"> <div class="page-intro__copy"><p class="eyebrow">About me</p><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1>Local knowledge. A personal perspective.</h1><div class="page-intro__lead"> <p>I’m Emma, an independent buying agent. I help you find and secure a home in Hertfordshire, west Essex and South Cambridgeshire.</p> <p>I work for you, the buyer, with your priorities at the heart of the search.</p> <a class="button" href="/contact/">Talk to me about your move<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a> </div></div> <div class="page-intro__media portrait"><img src="/images/emma-village-960.webp" srcset="/images/emma-village-480.webp 480w, /images/emma-village-960.webp 960w, /images/emma-village-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Emma Siddons outdoors in Hertfordshire" width="1080" height="721" fetchpriority="high"></div> </section> <section class="editorial editorial-grid about-perspective"> <div class="about-perspective__local"><p class="eyebrow">A place I know well</p><h2>More than a postcode</h2><p>Hertfordshire has been my home for more than 40 years. I know how much the feel of a place can change from one village to the next, and how important those differences are when choosing where to live.</p><p>I help you look beyond the particulars: the setting, the surrounding area and how a home could work for your everyday life.</p></div> <div class="about-perspective__background"><p class="eyebrow">My background</p><h2>A considered approach</h2><p>After studying law at UCL, I qualified as a chartered accountant with a Big Five firm and spent ten years in investment banking in the City.</p><p>That background informs the way I work: careful research, attention to detail and a clear head when it comes to negotiating a purchase.</p></div> </section> <section class="quiet-panel"><div class="editorial split-story"><img class="story-image" src="/images/emma-countryside-960.webp" srcset="/images/emma-countryside-480.webp 480w, /images/emma-countryside-960.webp 960w, /images/emma-countryside-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Emma with her dog in the Hertfordshire countryside" width="1600" height="1067" loading="lazy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Independent by choice</p><h2>You work directly with me</h2><p>I take on a small number of searches so I can give each client personal attention. From understanding your brief to keeping a purchase moving, I stay involved throughout.</p><p>My role is to be on your side: offering an independent view, helping you weigh up the options and knowing when a property is worth pursuing — or when it is time to walk away.</p><a class="button button--outline" href="/services-and-fees/">Explore my service<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></div></section> <section class="contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"> <div class="contact__copy"><h2 id="contact-title">Let’s talk about your next home</h2><p>Tell me what you are looking for, and I’ll explain how I can help.</p></div> <div class="contact__links"><a href="tel:+447702630983"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h4l2 5-3 2a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l2-3 5 2v4c0 1-1 2-2 2C10 21 3 14 3 5c0-1 1-2 2-2Z"></path></svg>07702 630983</a><a href="mailto:info@emmasiddons.com"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h18v14H3ZM3 6l9 7 9-7"></path></svg>info@emmasiddons.com</a></div> </section> </div><div class="about-brief">
  <section class="b-hero">
    <div class="wrap b-hero__grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">About me</p>
        <span class="rule"></span>
        <h1>Local knowledge. A personal perspective.</h1>
        <p class="lead">I’m Emma, an independent buying agent. I help you find and secure a home in Hertfordshire, west Essex and South Cambridgeshire. I work for you, the buyer, with your priorities at the heart of the search.</p>
        <div class="b-hero__actions">
          <a class="button" href="#talk">Talk to me about your move <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a>
          <a class="button button--light" href="#story">How I work</a>
        </div>
        <p class="trust"><span class="stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span> 5.0 on Google</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="arch reveal">
        <img src="/images/about-brief-0.webp" alt="Emma Siddons outdoors in Hertfordshire" width="1400" height="934" fetchpriority="high">
        <div class="badge"><strong>40+</strong><span>years living in Hertfordshire</span></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="facts" aria-label="Emma in brief">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ul class="facts__list reveal">
        <li><span class="facts__big">40+ yrs</span><span class="facts__label">Hertfordshire has been my home</span></li>
        <li><span class="facts__big">UCL</span><span class="facts__label">Studied law</span></li>
        <li><span class="facts__big">Big Five</span><span class="facts__label">Qualified chartered accountant</span></li>
        <li><span class="facts__big">10 yrs</span><span class="facts__label">In investment banking in the City</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
    <div class="wrap story__grid">
      <div class="story__intro reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">What I bring</p>
        <span class="rule"></span>
        <h2 id="story-title">Finding a home is personal. So is the way I work.</h2>
        <p>A home is more than its particulars. It is the place you come back to, the life around it and the feeling that it is right for you.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/how-i-can-help-you/">Explore my service</a>
      </div>
      <div class="principles">
        <article class="principle reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="20" r="8"></circle><path d="M24 28v14M18 36h12M6 42h36"></path></svg>
          <h3>Independent</h3>
          <p>I work for you, the buyer. My role is to be on your side and offer an independent view.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="principle reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="16" r="7"></circle><path d="M10 42c0-8 6-14 14-14s14 6 14 14"></path></svg>
          <h3>Personal</h3>
          <p>I take on a small number of searches, and you work directly with me throughout.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="principle reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 8h22l6 6v26H10z"></path><path d="M16 20h16M16 27h16M16 34h10"></path></svg>
          <h3>Considered</h3>
          <p>Careful research, attention to detail and a clear head when it comes to negotiating a purchase.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="principle reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 42s-13-12-13-22a13 13 0 0 1 26 0c0 10-13 22-13 22z"></path><circle cx="24" cy="20" r="5"></circle></svg>
          <h3>Local</h3>
          <p>I know how much the feel of a place can change from one village to the next.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="principle principle--wide reveal">
          <img src="/images/about-brief-1.webp" alt="Emma with her dog in the Hertfordshire countryside" loading="lazy" style="object-position:30% 50%" width="1400" height="934">
          <div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 24h28m-10-10 10 10-10 10"></path><circle cx="40" cy="24" r="2"></circle></svg>
            <h3>With you to the end</h3>
            <p>From understanding your brief to keeping a purchase moving, I stay involved throughout, and I’ll tell you when a property is worth pursuing, or when it is time to walk away.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reviews" aria-labelledby="reviews-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="reviews__head reveal">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Kind words from my clients</p><span class="rule"></span><h2 id="reviews-title">In their words.</h2></div>

      </div>
      <div class="reviews__track" tabindex="0" aria-label="Client reviews">
        <article class="review"><div><span class="stars" aria-label="Five stars">★★★★★</span><blockquote>“Emma is quite simply exceptional at what she does.”</blockquote></div><cite><b>Mark Sheldon</b></cite></article>
        <article class="review"><div><span class="stars" aria-label="Five stars">★★★★★</span><blockquote>“Emma has been brilliant to have in our corner across two properties now.”</blockquote></div><cite><b>Oriel Gordon</b></cite></article>
        <article class="review"><div><span class="stars" aria-label="Five stars">★★★★★</span><blockquote>“Working with Emma was a great experience from start to finish.”</blockquote></div><cite><b>Andy Clark</b></cite></article>
        <article class="review"><div><span class="stars" aria-label="Five stars">★★★★★</span><blockquote>“Emma knew what we needed before even we did and we are so grateful.”</blockquote></div><cite><b>Anna Touschek</b></cite></article>
        <article class="review"><div><span class="stars" aria-label="Five stars">★★★★★</span><blockquote>“We would never even have thought to view our new house without Emma's guidance.”</blockquote></div><cite><b>Nick Daly</b></cite></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="qa" aria-labelledby="qa-title">
    <div class="wrap qa__grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Working with me</p>
        <span class="rule"></span>
        <h2 id="qa-title">A few things you may be wondering.</h2>
        <p>And if you would rather talk it through, I’m always happy to hear about your plans.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <details open=""><summary>Will I work with you directly?</summary><p>Yes. My business is personal: you work directly with me throughout the search. I take on a small number of clients and avoid searches that would put my clients in direct competition with each other.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can you help if I don’t know the area?</summary><p>Yes. We can start with what matters to you rather than a postcode. I help you focus your search across Hertfordshire, west Essex and South Cambridgeshire, considering how each location could work for your life.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What does a buying agent do?</summary><p>I represent you, the buyer. I help define your brief, find and assess suitable homes, negotiate a purchase and support you through to completion. The selling agent represents the seller; I am there to look after your interests.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How do I get started?</summary><p>Call or email me and tell me a little about your plans. We can discuss where you are looking, your timing and the support you need. I will explain my service and agree the fee arrangement with you before any work begins.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="talk" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta__card reveal">
        <img src="/images/about-brief-2.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="320" height="214">
        <div><h2 id="cta-title">Let’s talk about your next home.</h2><p>Tell me what you are looking for, and I’ll explain how I can help.</p></div>
        <div class="cta__actions">
          <a class="button" href="tel:+447702630983">07702 630983</a>
          <a class="button button--ghost" href="mailto:info@emmasiddons.com">info@emmasiddons.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div></main> <SiteFooter /> <script>import '../../scripts/about-reviews';</script></SiteLayout>
